# Customer Onboarding Metrics - Q4 2025

| Metric | Value |
|---|---|
| **Average Onboarding Time** | 52 days |
| **Target Onboarding Time** | 45 days |
| **% Completed on Time** | 68% |
| **Customer Satisfaction (CSAT)** | 4.6 / 5.0 |

## Analysis

- Onboarding time is slightly above target, primarily due to delays in EHR integration.
- Customer satisfaction remains high, indicating that customers are happy with the onboarding experience despite the longer timeline.

## Improvement Initiatives

- Streamline the EHR integration process
- Provide more self-service resources
- Increase training capacity
